WEBVTT

00:00:08.039 --> 00:00:12.360
Eight minutes and twenty from your face to mine

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:17.000
everything I see of you is running behind

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.260
sprinklers on the driveway and the radio on

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:24.720
all of this light left before you were gone

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.320
We've been falling since the day we met

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.740
round and round and never landing yet

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.580
You went dark

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.840
but you didn't let go

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:50.020
all I see is your ghost

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:55.720
and I'm still falling for you

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.140
The far galaxies leave, going red as they go

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.120
the whole sky was burning once, now it barely glows

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.619
some of the snow on the TV is that light

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:09.180
thirteen point eight billion years of goodbye

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.900
We asked the dark, where is everybody?

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.200
one night in Ohio a signal, then Wow

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.730
and the sky never said it again

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:26.280
You went dark

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:30.920
but you didn't let go

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:35.740
all we see is your ghost

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:41.700
and we're still falling for you

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.440
Fall in slow

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:46.920
from out here you never go

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:50.080
you just stop at the edge and turn red

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.280
everything you were is written on the edge

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.500
nothing gets lost, we think

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:04.020
You went dark

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:07.500
all I see is your ghost

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.720
you went

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:13.440
DARK!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:17.780
you didn't let go
